<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενο-δόκος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξεινοδόκος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one
				who receives strangers, host,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵν᾽ ὁμῶς τερπώμεθα πάντες ξεινοδόκοι
					καὶ ξεῖνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.543
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξεῖνος μιμνήσκεται ἤματα πάντα ἀνδρὸς
					ξεινοδόκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.354
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.210
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				16.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.96a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.15
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.):—later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενο-δόχος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.17
			</span></i>, al.; <i>head of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενοδοχεῖον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>witness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				84.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>—The forms <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενοδόχος,
				-δοχέω, -δοχία</span> are condemned by Moer.<i><span class="en">
				p.271
			</span></i> P., Thom.Mag.<i><span class="en">
				p.251
			</span></i> R. ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενηδόκος.</span></div>
